-- JobEntries: Table: JobEntries. Career history, shared by both resume variants via inclusion flags rather than duplicated per variant. Rows are grouped by DisplayGroupKey where a variant collapses multiple rows into one displayed entry (e.g. Variant A merges the two Power Automate roles).
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
